과 모든 내부 이동은 orderedAnchors로 보존하며 독립 발음으로 분리하지 않는다.\", \"spectralCheck\": \"각 선택창 중심의 Hann FFT에서 YIN F0 주변 피크를 대조. 짧은 경유음의 창은4096샘플보다 짧아 인접음 영향이 남을 수 있다.\", \"orderedAnchors\": [{\"f0Hz\": 691.109, \"p10Hz\": 690.391, \"p90Hz\": 692.468, \"register\": \"평취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"태\", \"validFrames\": 135, \"windowsSeconds\": [[0.3, 1.65]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 691.754}, {\"f0Hz\": 807.112, \"p10Hz\": 807.063, \"p90Hz\": 807.281, \"register\": \"역취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"중\", \"validFrames\": 7, \"windowsSeconds\": [[1.8, 1.87]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 806.654}, {\"f0Hz\": 689.69, \"p10Hz\": 688.381, \"p90Hz\": 690.335, \"register\": \"평취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"태\", \"validFrames\": 10, \"windowsSeconds\": [[1.97, 2.07]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 689.231}, {\"f0Hz\": 609.151, \"p10Hz\": 607.933, \"p90Hz\": 610.686, \"register\": \"평취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"황\", \"validFrames\": 22, \"windowsSeconds\": [[2.18, 2.4]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 609.322}, {\"f0Hz\": 685.996, \"p10Hz\": 685.365, \"p90Hz\": 687.137, \"register\": \"평취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"태\", \"validFrames\": 17, \"windowsSeconds\": [[2.51, 2.68]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 686.203}], \"labelAnchorIndex\": 4}}, \"register\": \"평취\", \"sourceId\": \"ngc-danso-2349\", \"technique\": \"느르나니\", \"yulmyeong\": \"태\", \"endSeconds\": 2.79288, \"processing\": \"channel mean; attenuation only above 0.999; PCM16; no resampling/pitch correction\", \"displayLabel\": \"평취 태\", \"sampleRateHz\": 44100, \"startSeconds\": 0.14, \"sourceStartFrame\": 6174, \"eligibleForNoteScoring\": false, \"sourceEndFrameExclusive\": 123166}, \"source\": {\"id\": \"ngc-danso-2349\", \"kind\": \"audio\", \"bytes\": 720732, \"title\": \"느르나니\", \"sha256\": \"143c04b11aa82086e0a2e47ed100d3e38e1db3b488d84328967514f523aa8029\", \"license\": \"KOGL-1\", \"rawPath\": \"data/raw/instruments/danso/Danso_12.wav\", \"category\": \"시김새\", \"channels\": 2, \"publisher\": \"국립국악원\", \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.gugak.go.kr/digitaleum/front/monotone/list.