inal inference, not measured tuning or a claim that 본청C means 황종C. ngc-sanjo-2552.region-004 alternatives remain excluded. No new acoustic/performer review; not scoring truth. Original inferred and eligibleForNoteScoring=false remain unchanged. Manifest SHA256=5450071ea3f8cf6c53e7a20c3800be015cdc755717213c339475ee3696c0a6fb','PUBLISHED','2026-11-02 06:46:34.856255','2026-11-02 07:05:49.424225');
