 안정 발음 전체 중앙 F0. 공식 제목이 황종을 직접 지정한다.\", \"spectralCheck\": \"각 선택창 중심의 Hann FFT에서 YIN F0 주변 피크를 대조. 짧은 경유음의 창은4096샘플보다 짧아 인접음 영향이 남을 수 있다.\", \"orderedAnchors\": [{\"f0Hz\": 596.676, \"p10Hz\": 583.828, \"p90Hz\": 608.988, \"register\": \"평취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"황\", \"validFrames\": 590, \"windowsSeconds\": [[0.5, 6.4]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 606.967}], \"labelAnchorIndex\": 0}}, \"register\": \"평취\", \"sourceId\": \"ngc-danso-2343\", \"technique\": \"요성(황종)\", \"yulmyeong\": \"황\", \"endSeconds\": 6.71288, \"processing\": \"channel mean; attenuation only above 0.999; PCM16; no resampling/pitch correction\", \"displayLabel\": \"평취 황\", \"sampleRateHz\": 44100, \"startSeconds\": 0.12, \"sourceStartFrame\": 5292, \"eligibleForNoteScoring\": false, \"sourceEndFrameExclusive\": 296038}, \"source\": {\"id\": \"ngc-danso-2343\", \"kind\": \"audio\", \"bytes\": 1336956, \"title\": \"요성(황종)\", \"sha256\": \"782187095a9e550d011d4da554b2e057b15f48fc8a8471aa010661e4ecc3db97\", \"license\": \"KOGL-1\", \"rawPath\": \"data/raw/instruments/danso/Danso_6.wav\", \"category\": \"시김새\", \"channels\": 2, \"publisher\": \"국립국악원\", \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.gugak.go.kr/digitaleum/front/monotone/list.do\", \"verifiedOn\": \"2026-10-23\", \"attribution\": \"국립국악원, 국악기 디지털 음원, 단소, 요성(황종), mntn_seq=2343, 공공누리 제1유형(출처표시)\", \"downloadUrl\": \"https://www.gugak.go.kr/digitaleum/cmmn/file/monotone/download.do\", \"sampleRateHz\": 44100, \"sourceItemId\": 2343, \"annotationPath\": \"data/annotations/audio/danso/ngc-danso-2343-요성(황종)/labels.json\", \"instrumentCode\": 19860, \"redistribution\": {\"adapted\": \"possible_with_conditions\", \"original\": \"possible_with_conditions\", \"conditions\": [\"출처표시\", \"가공한 경우 변경 내용 표시\"]}, \"durationSeconds\": 7.578662131519274}, \"encoding\": {\"peak\": 0.644589900970459, \"codec\": \"aac\", \"ffmpeg\": \"ffmpeg version 9.0.2-essentials_build-www.gyan.dev Copyright (c) 2000-2026 the FFmpeg developers\", \"ffprobe\": \"ffprobe version 9.0.2-essentials_build-www.gyan.dev Copyright (c) 2007-2026 the FFmpeg developers\", \"profile\": \"LC\", \"processing\": \"AAC-LC compression only; no resampling, pitch correction, normalization or trimming\", \"decodedFrames\": 290746, \"targetBitRate\": 192000, \"encodedBitRate\": 161661, \"containerSeconds\": 6.59288, \"endPaddingFrames\": 0}, \"instrument\": \"단소\", \"catalogSha256\": \"5f36c029663bc043c99f143711c1b4f16994979171a40d84bbcedaa06cbad311\"}',NULL,NULL,'PUBLISHED','2026-11-02 06:46:34.856255','2026-11-02 07:05:49.424225');
