 주음과 모든 내부 이동은 orderedAnchors로 보존하며 독립 발음으로 분리하지 않는다.\", \"spectralCheck\": \"각 선택창 중심의 Hann FFT에서 YIN F0 주변 피크를 대조. 짧은 경유음의 창은4096샘플보다 짧아 인접음 영향이 남을 수 있다.\", \"orderedAnchors\": [{\"f0Hz\": 818.356, \"p10Hz\": 816.924, \"p90Hz\": 820.006, \"register\": \"역취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"중\", \"validFrames\": 150, \"windowsSeconds\": [[0.4, 1.9]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 820.617}, {\"f0Hz\": 891.397, \"p10Hz\": 891.188, \"p90Hz\": 892.109, \"register\": \"역취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"임\", \"validFrames\": 8, \"windowsSeconds\": [[2.03, 2.11]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 890.768}, {\"f0Hz\": 1049.289, \"p10Hz\": 1048.415, \"p90Hz\": 1049.661, \"register\": \"역취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"무\", \"validFrames\": 7, \"windowsSeconds\": [[2.2, 2.27]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 1049.575}, {\"f0Hz\": 894.91, \"p10Hz\": 890.023, \"p90Hz\": 896.253, \"register\": \"역취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"임\", \"validFrames\": 5, \"windowsSeconds\": [[2.38, 2.43]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 894.301}, {\"f0Hz\": 821.338, \"p10Hz\": 821.05, \"p90Hz\": 822.573, \"register\": \"역취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"중\", \"validFrames\": 5, \"windowsSeconds\": [[2.49, 2.54]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 817.589}, {\"f0Hz\": 1055.845, \"p10Hz\": 1051.835, \"p90Hz\": 1056.976, \"register\": \"역취\", \"yulmyeong\": \"무\", \"validFrames\": 14, \"windowsSeconds\": [[2.64, 2.78]], \"spectralPeakNearF0Hz\": 1055.968}], \"labelAnchorIndex\": 5}}, \"register\": \"역취\", \"sourceId\": \"ngc-danso-2348\", \"technique\": \"느니르나니\", \"yulmyeong\": \"무\", \"endSeconds\": 2.91288, \"processing\": \"channel mean; attenuation only above 0.999; PCM16; no resampling/pitch correction\", \"displayLabel\": \"역취 무\", \"sampleRateHz\": 44100, \"startSeconds\": 0.15, \"sourceStartFrame\": 6615, \"eligibleForNoteScoring\": false, \"sourceEndFrameExclusive\": 128458}, \"source\": {\"id\": \"ngc-danso-2348\", \"kind\": \"audio\", \"bytes\": 720732, \"title\": \"느니르나니\", \"sha256\": \"fe163cb414b492036491ed0abbe8e89c569226552b80a8afee82a122cc762a9c\", \"license\": \"